    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Email Marketing Specialist.\n\nYour task is to write ONE personalized marketing email for the customer described below.\n\nCustomer Details\n\nFirst Name: {{ $json[\"First Name\"] }}\nLast Name: {{ $json[\"Last Name\"] }}\nCompany: {{ $json[\"Company\"] }}\nIndustry: {{ $json[\"Industry\"] }}\nCountry: {{ $json[\"Country\"] }}\nCustomer Segment: {{ $json[\"Customer Segment\"] }}\nInterest: {{ $json[\"Interest\"] }}\nLast Purchase: {{ $json[\"Last Purchase\"] }}\nPreferred Tone: {{ $json[\"Preferred Tone\"] }}\n\nYour company offers AI Automation Services that help businesses:\n\n- Automate repetitive work\n- Reduce manual tasks\n- Improve productivity\n- Save time\n- Integrate AI into existing workflows\n\nRequirements\n\n- Address the customer by their first name.\n- Mention their company naturally.\n- Mention their industry naturally.\n- Relate the email to their interest.\n- Match the preferred tone.\n- Keep the email between 100 and 150 words.\n- Include one compelling call-to-action.\n- Write a professional and human-sounding email.\n\nImportant:\n\nThe customer information above already contains the final values.\n\nDo NOT output template variables.\n\nDo NOT output placeholder text.\n\nUse the actual customer information exactly as provided.\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON object.\n\n{\n  \"subject\": \"Email subject\",\n  \"body\": \"Email body\"\n}",
